    "The headline sensitivity of 87% (Table 6) applies to the 'Chip both donors' analysis. The records list all 27 drugs with their 'Chip MOS both donors' scores from Table 4 where available, or donor 1/2 if 'both' is missing but implied in the aggregate. Note that Table 6 counts sum to 18 units (13+3+0+2), implying some drugs were excluded from the 'both donors' calculation due to missing data (e.g., Asunaprevir has no Donor 2 data). The contract includes all drugs with available score references.",
